  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "i.e. a host may create a server with a name where others can join. They can appoint their own local admins and mods and they can also use basic commands such as teleporting and can change the server map (relocation) to another; this may also be accompanied by adding map lists in that server (such as making one world the hub and adding other maps as zones). Players will also not be allowed to spawn portals (most likely). Suggesting as a better way to play with others, designated RP, gaming, shooting servers, etc. Will also help remove exploiters from worlds, at least more quickly, and create sub-communities. Another pro would be you could see the ping, maps, users, description... when viewing  the server's info.",
